  "restoreInstructions": [
    "Download every source/API/ZIP asset from its durable release URL, verify its exact SHA-256 and byte count before extraction or use, and preserve the downloaded API bytes without JSON reserialization.",
    "Restore the frozen source3 archive with manifest modes into source.installedSourcePath. The complete source3 manifest must contain exactly 4889 verified entries. Restore the captured support input archive into support.installedPath for assembly.",
    "For each artifact, put the verified ZIP at installedVerifierZipPath and safely extract regular members into installedVerifierRestoredPath. Reject traversal, symlinks, nonregular entries, duplicate/case/Unicode aliases and unsafe member patterns. Never execute archive code during restoration.",
    "Write provenance.exactRecords as the array at provenance.installedPath. Put API capture bytes at their installedVerifierPath. The parentTransfer paths are optional developer-side staging locations; production verification reads the installedVerifier paths.",
    "Use the additive installed scripts/ci/verify-macos-engine-results-progress3.mjs with --platform macos-arm64 or --platform macos-x64. Public installed code depends on scripts/ci and scripts/lib, never candidate-owned build code.",
    "Aggregate verification and candidate native assembly do not establish exact target runtime or exact public-download qualification."
